  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UYrNpKJN/images/28fbdff482a08cd94d0873f5bc26922efe5e5e11.png\" alt=\"堆疊方塊\" width=\"332\" height=\"96\"></p><p><strong>前所未有的最大化儲存空間。</strong>將八個方塊壓縮成一個，例如木原木、石頭、地獄石、磚塊等，為你最重要的資源騰出寶貴空間。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stacked-blocks/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=26.1&amp;showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下載 26.1 更新\" width=\"217\" height=\"36\"></a></p><h2>🧰 功能特色</h2><ul>\n<li>使用拴繩堆疊木原木、石頭、鵝卵石、地獄石、西瓜、南瓜等方塊。</li>\n<li>在一個簡易儲物箱中儲存多達 13,824 個物品，釋放空間給其他資源。</li>\n<li>透過堆疊方式整理資源，打造更整潔、更有效率的儲存系統。</li>\n</ul><h2>🛠️ 附加模組</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stacked-blocks-farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">堆疊方塊：農夫樂事</a><br>\n<ul>\n<li>新增使用繩索製作可堆疊方塊的功能。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stacked-blocks-supplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\">堆疊方塊：補充品</a><br>\n<ul>\n<li>壓縮如灰燼磚、黑石磚、泥磚等方塊。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"正在為筆記型電腦存錢！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"贊助我按鈕\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐贈按鈕\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
